- **DeviceDelta**: { device_id, timestamp, delta_value, noise_added, privacy_spent }
- **BudgetLedger**: { device_id, total_budget, spent_budget, remaining_budget, last_updated }
- **GlobalAggregate**: { window_start, window_end, sum_deltas, participant_count, noise_offset }
- **BudgetProof**: { device_id, ledger_hash, merkle_proof, signature }

